        <title type="html"><![CDATA[docs(webextensions): document cross-browser MV3 background fallback]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44108</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/44108"/>
        <updated>2026-05-13T14:47:50.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/58849388?u=08f6cc6d91f53b66e6fce613311b6868aa6f16cf&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h2 dir="auto">Summary</h2>
<p dir="auto">Adds a focused section to the WebExtensions <code class="notranslate">background</code> manifest documentation explaining how a Manifest V3 extension can specify both <code class="notranslate">background.scripts</code> and <code class="notranslate">background.service_worker</code> for cross-browser background behavior.</p>
<p dir="auto">The update also clarifies that <code class="notranslate">background.preferred_environment</code> is not required for the basic fallback behavior, and should only be used when an extension specifically wants to prefer a service worker where available.</p>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #44100.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4433445950" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44100" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/44100/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/44100">#44100</a>.</p>
